Train and weather info for the display at github.com/tenpn/unicorn.

A small Flask app (app.py) hosted on Vercel. Pushing to master deploys it.

Endpoints (all need ?code=<API_KEY>):
  /api/localinfo?trainFrom=KNN&trainTo=BHX&weather=B30
      departure times from trainFrom to trainTo, plus today's weather for a postcode
  /api/trainline?left_crs=BHM&right_crs=KNN
      trains running in both directions between two stations, with the time they reach each stop

Environment variables (set in the Vercel project settings):
  API_KEY      shared secret that clients pass as ?code=
  ldbwsAuth    National Rail LDBWS access token
  weatherAuth  weatherapi.com key

Run locally:
  pip install -r requirements.txt
  API_KEY=test ldbwsAuth=... weatherAuth=... flask --app app run
